q 360 0 0 129.375 126 674 cm /Im1 Do Q q 0 0 0 rg BT 19.2 TL/F2 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 193.536 640 Tm T* ET BT 18 TL/F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 210.5625 618 Tm (Parent & Family Handbook)Tj T* ET BT 14.4 TL/F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 223.638 590 Tm (Respect. Intensity. Progress.)Tj T* ET q 145 0 0 52.10937 233.5 237 cm /Im2 Do Q BT 13.2 TL/F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 557 Tm T* ET BT 1 0 0 1 54 541.5 Tm (program. It is written for players, parents, families, and coaches so that everyone understands what we)Tj T* ET BT 1 0 0 1 54 526 Tm (are building and how we will build it together.)Tj T* ET BT 1 0 0 1 54 502 Tm T* ET BT 1 0 0 1 54 486.5 Tm (grow in skill, confidence, discipline, teamwork, leadership, and character. If IRS 501\(c\)\(3\) recognition or)Tj T* ET BT 1 0 0 1 54 471 Tm (tax-deductible donation language is being referenced externally, families and sponsors should rely on)Tj T* ET BT 1 0 0 1 54 455.5 Tm (the organization's official IRS documentation and current approval status.)Tj T* ET BT 1 0 0 1 54 431.5 Tm (Our goal is bigger than winning games. We want to compete hard, learn the game the right way, and)Tj T* ET BT 1 0 0 1 54 416 Tm T* ET BT 1 0 0 1 54 400.5 Tm (pressure, temperance when emotions rise, justice in how they treat others, and progress through)Tj T* ET BT 1 0 0 1 54 385 Tm (repeated effort.)Tj T* ET BT 1 0 0 1 54 361 Tm (This is not a rulebook meant to catch families doing something wrong. It is a shared standard. When)Tj T* ET BT 1 0 0 1 54 345.5 Tm (expectations are clear, players feel safer, parents know how to support the team, and coaches can)Tj T* ET BT 1 0 0 1 54 330 Tm (focus on development instead of confusion.)Tj T* ET BT 1 0 0 1 54 306 Tm (Our core identity is simple: Respect. Intensity. Progress.)Tj T* ET .7 0 .08 RG .7 w 39.6 28 m 572.4 28 l S .419608 .419608 .419608 rg BT 7.8 TL/F1 6.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 224.23 14.5 Tm T* ET Q q 0 0 0 rg 0 0 0 RG BT/hebo 16 Tf 1 0 0 1 233.112 640 Tm[(Rough Rider Youth)]TJ ET Q q 0 0 0 rg 0 0 0 RG BT/helv 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 557 Tm[(This handbook explains the culture, expectations, and shared commitments of our)]TJ ET Q q 0 0 0 rg 0 0 0 RG BT/helv 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 502 Tm[(Rough Rider Youth operates with a youth-sports nonprofit mission: using athletics to help players)]TJ ET Q q 0 0 0 rg 0 0 0 RG BT/helv 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 54 416 Tm[(help young athletes become stronger people. The game gives them a place to practice courage under)]TJ ET Q q .41960786 .41960786 .41960786 rg .41960786 .41960786 .41960786 RG BT/helv 6.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 239.22225 14.5 Tm[(Rough Rider Youth Family Handbook | Page 1)]TJ ET Q
